Package: localsend-pro
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.12), python3-venv
Description: secure local-network file and text sharing application
 LocalSend Pro discovers devices on the local network and lets users send files
 and text messages directly between them. Transfers are encrypted and incoming
 files require the recipient's approval.
